    "offset_14": "Separate user section number, used by error-report paths01f4 and0200; not the zero-based table index used by getsectionptr.",
    "offset_16": "File paragraph size, read into CX0306 independently of memory size.",
    "offset_2": "Filename record pointer: original0c3d points at00 followed by POP.EXE NUL. Open0444 increments the pointer and tests preceding flag byte.",
    "offset_4_and_6": "24-bit file paragraph position; the loader converts it to CX:DX byte position. Conditional internal EXE offset adjustment remains in code.",
    "offset_7": "Loader tests01 for preload,02 for resident-in-memory,08 for filename indirection,20 for compressed path. Do not equate04 with ordinary-code classification.",
    "offset_8": "Memory paragraph size: used by overlap/clear paths and by clean remainder after file read."
  },
